  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Erection of single storey&nbsp; ground floor side infill extension and rear dormer and two front two flights",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed single-storey side extension, by reason of its size, scale, bulk, and detailed design, would result in an overly large, disproportionate, and poor quality extension that would be out of character with the architectural design of the original dwelling and the wider terrace, particularly when combined with the existing extensions to the property. The proposal would fail both to represent good design and preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the conservation area. As such, the proposal fails to comply with policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets), and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and policies D3 (&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;Optimising capacity through the design-led approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;), D4 (Delivering good design), and HC1 (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-d48a9eb8-7fff-4266-e5a9-720c51317033&quot;&gt;Heritage conservation and growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;) of the London Plan (2021) and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
